# Fecundity: only "a creature dies" counts. Bot1 destroys Bot2's Mox Ruby with Abrupt Decay (a permanent dying that is
# not a creature) and exiles its Ornithopter with Path to Exile (a creature leaving without dying, CR 700.4): after each
# the stack is empty, so no trigger was put on it. The positive control is the neighbouring scenarios, where a creature
# that dies does trigger it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Fecundity
Abrupt Decay
Path to Exile
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
